# The four Apple SAP binaries in VendorAssets/ are ~119 MB and were tracked
# with git-lfs in the upstream repository. This fork does not have the LFS
# objects, so the directory is ignored. Users must obtain the binaries from
# https://github.com/a23bc/dlipa-rebuild (run `git lfs pull` there) and copy
# them into VendorAssets/ before building.
